  "application_type_full": "Full planning permission",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed cycle storage, by virtue of its means of access down a narrow shared alleyway would fail to provide an accessible, convenient and functional facility for all types of bicycles and would fail to promote or prioritise the use of sustainable modes of transport, contrary to Section 9 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies T2 and T5 of the London Plan (2021), CP25 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), DMD45 and DMD47 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014).",
    "The development, by virtue of the site's constraints, cannot satisfactorily accommodate all operational requirements of the proposed HMO, including the necessary refuse and cycle storage provision associated with the significant intensification of the property's use. The proposal is therefore contrary to criterion (d) of Policy DMD5, Section 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework, Policies D3, D4 and D8 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), and Policies DMD6 and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
  ],
